    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FULLY RELEASED!!!! - NEW UPDATE as of 3/3/25</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 When a power-hungry warlock opens up a portal to monstrous dimensions, building an army with the creatures he finds, they quickly overwhelm him and spread throughout your world. You are one of the last few heroes that can save your planet in its darkest hours.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/c83837024ba08e2f1a29d97f40d83172.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/b1661b869f5515353270b4cd8808fe0d.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Monster Portal is a roguelite with dungeon-crawler like elements. It follows one of your world's last few powerful heroes, sent on a quest to rid the planet of monsters and their gruesome overlords that have overtaken your world from hellish dimensions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/014972beb312040506c1c6ee6b783b0a.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 unique classes with 12 different unlock-able game variants giving you 36 different ways to play the game   <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 32 gems that give you unique powers   <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choices to level up gems or character stats when the player levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hundreds of active slot combinations you can create with your gems to use on the fly to beat a level or boss  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 25+ monstrous enemy types </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaos Totem (slot machine of positive/negative effects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 bosses  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 additional Loot bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 levels  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique hero ultimates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 difficulty settings   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/8a91fe0a6984f7e2de1bcd9b499c4b0c.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/ffb062f68515f7fd96fd5ea2a7588eda.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/fa66475b9014f3399b1ca191a713ac47.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/c2cab4ee397b03758e90fb1c6938b374.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/d478989fefa03304380c3b00c974ca1f.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mix and match an assortment of gems that give you powers from crowd control, healing, magical turrets, and more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Earn trophies for your collection by following different paths!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/565310046d909aac2df0db2fe52d68ad.avif?t=1751875957\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/0686e7bc14a44fd2eca4cb11c0e3382a.avif?t=1751875957\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FULLY RELEASED!!!! - NEW UPDATE as of 3/3/25</strong>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 When a power-hungry warlock opens up a portal to monstrous dimensions, building an army with the creatures he finds, they quickly overwhelm him and spread throughout your world. You are one of the last few heroes that can save your planet in its darkest hours.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/c83837024ba08e2f1a29d97f40d83172.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/b1661b869f5515353270b4cd8808fe0d.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Monster Portal is a roguelite with dungeon-crawler like elements. It follows one of your world's last few powerful heroes, sent on a quest to rid the planet of monsters and their gruesome overlords that have overtaken your world from hellish dimensions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/014972beb312040506c1c6ee6b783b0a.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 unique classes with 12 different unlock-able game variants giving you 36 different ways to play the game   <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 32 gems that give you unique powers   <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choices to level up gems or character stats when the player levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hundreds of active slot combinations you can create with your gems to use on the fly to beat a level or boss  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 25+ monstrous enemy types </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaos Totem (slot machine of positive/negative effects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 bosses  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 additional Loot bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 levels  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique hero ultimates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 difficulty settings   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/8a91fe0a6984f7e2de1bcd9b499c4b0c.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/ffb062f68515f7fd96fd5ea2a7588eda.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/fa66475b9014f3399b1ca191a713ac47.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/c2cab4ee397b03758e90fb1c6938b374.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419140/extras/d478989fefa03304380c3b00c974ca1f.avif?t=1751875957\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mix and match an assortment of gems that give you powers from crowd control, healing, magical turrets, and more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Earn trophies for y